bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Check duplicate email and username

control AuthService
control UserService
entity ":UserModel" as UserModel
database MongoDB

AuthService -> UserService: 1. Get user by email
activate AuthService
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 2. findOne({ email })
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 3. Get user data
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 4. User / null
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 5. User / null
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> AuthService: 6. Result
deactivate UserService

AuthService -> UserService: 7. Get user by username
activate UserService
UserService -> UserModel: 8. findOne({ username })
activate UserModel
UserModel -> MongoDB: 9. Get user data
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> UserModel: 10. User / null
deactivate MongoDB
UserModel --> UserService: 11. User / null
deactivate UserModel
UserService --> AuthService: 12. Result
deactivate AuthService
deactivate UserService